---
import '../styles/global.css' 
import Header from '../components/header.astro'
---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>EDUPSCH</title>
	</head>

<body class="m-0 pt-15">

    <Header/>

    <!-- grid-rows-26 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-5 ">

        
        <div class="row-start-6 col-start-2 col-span-2 row-span-2 place-self-center grayscale z-0">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/boi.jpg" class="w-30 p-2">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-8 col-start-2 col-span-2 place-self-center pl-3 pr-3">
            <img src="http://dl.glitter-graphics.net/pub/621/621641xy2arhaa2t.gif" >
        </div>

        <!-- nattehimmel -->
        <div class="row-start-5 col-start-4 row-span-2 place-self-center">
            <img class="p-5" src="http://dl3.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1726/1726203ha2mjbxeje.gif" width=83 height=100 >
        </div>
        
        <div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[30px]">
                have you ever had a dream that you, um, you had, your, you- you could, you'll do, you- you wants, you, you could do so, you- you'll do, you could- you, you want, you want them to do you so much you could do anything?
            </p>
        </div>

        
        
        
        <div class="z-10 row-start-9 col-start-1 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/boi.jpg" class="hue-rotate-90 invert w-30 place-self-center">
        </div>
        
        <div class="z-0 row-start-10 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-5">
            <img src="/billeder/musikvideo/hvid.jpg" class="w-200 blur-3xl">
        </div>
        
        
        <!-- regnbue -->
        <div class="z-10 row-start-10 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2">
            <img class="w-full" src="http://dl7.glitter-graphics.net/pub/865/865387j5kbdyehac.gif" width=150 height=61>
        </div>
        
        <p class="z-10 row-start-11 col-start-1 col-span-4 text-center font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[40px]">
            the lucid castle
        </p>
        <p class="z-10 row-start-12 col-start-1 col-span-4 font-serif text-center text-blue-600 text-[20px] pl-5">
            you are caught in a lucid dream..
            <br> you find yourself in a castle, where a sleepy queen reigns. be not afraid..
        </p>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-13 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-3 ">
            <video autoplay muted loop controls>
                <source src="/billeder/musikvideo/lucidcastle.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>


        <div class="z-10 row-start-16 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-2 pl-21">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] text-right">
                i am very fascinated by dreams & memory & the (un)concious mind. 
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-18 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-4 pl-22">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] text-right">
                in this dream, you will meet a biblically correct angel, a beefy (but tender) woman, illuminati himself & a monkey man looking for his monkey boy.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-21 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2 ">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px]">
                the experience is made in blender & three.js in the span of ca. two weeks.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-24 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2 place-self-center">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-blue-600 text-[40px] text-center">
                what was I thinking?! 
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="z-10 row-start-26 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[20px] pl-8">
                I absolutely wanted to make something so twisted, that I would be afraid to actually show it to anyone.
                <br> 
                <br> very inspired by the indie game <span class="font-bold italic">"Crypt Underworld"</span> by Lilith Zone, i created my own dream world, where I am the sleepy queen.
                <br> 
                <br> in a way, this experience is me bringing you into the colorful fog of my slumber. 
                <br> 
                <br> I let you watch me sleep, & trust you with my dreams.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- drømmefanger -->
       <div class="row-start-30 col-start-2 row-span-2 col-span-2 place-self-center pt-5">
            <img class="w-full" src="http://dl6.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1941/1941536whig82new2.gif" width=201 height=289 >
       </div>


        
        <!-- små søde modeller -->
        <div class="z-0 row-start-16 col-start-1 col-span-2">
            <img class="w-80" src="/billeder/musikvideo/abedreng.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-17 col-start-1 col-span-2">
            <img class="w-80" src="/billeder/musikvideo/engel.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-18 col-start-1 col-span-2">
            <img class="w-80" src="/billeder/musikvideo/illuminati.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-19 col-start-1 col-span-2">
            <img class="w-80" src="/billeder/musikvideo/meatlady.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-20 col-start-1 col-span-2">
            <img class="w-80" src="/billeder/musikvideo/abefar.gif" class="saturate-150">
        </div>

        









    </div>

</body>
</html>